config BR2_PACKAGE_HWDOG
	bool "hwdog"
	help
	  Pets the PX30's hardware watchdog (/dev/watchdog), which U-Boot
	  starts and the kernel pets until this opens it: from init's first
	  step on, every 10 s with a 60 s timeout, locked in RAM and at a
	  real-time priority, so a long copy to a slow card never makes it
	  late. A kernel that stops is reset. Stopped by a shutdown's TERM.
	  zytest=hang or zytest=stall on the kernel's line tests the chain.
